[[0,1444821,0,75,7,68,"2016-11-29T01:12:24","skymod","",[],"","What 200mph on regular roads looks like","http://i.imgur.com/XveKlQk.mp4","interestingasfuck"],[1,6977396,0,2,0,2,"2016-11-29T01:52:04","U235","",[],"<p>&lt;3 IOM TT</p>"],[1,6977407,0,14,0,14,"2016-11-29T01:52:44","tjkac","",[],"<p>That's the Isle of Man TT race. It is held every year. The best sport motorcycle racers in the world go there and compete for little more than bragging rights. It is also the most dangerous motorsport race in the world. Those guys are just insane.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iRWp9rhfS_0\">Video of the Isle of Man TT race</a></p>"],[2,6978691,6977407,1,0,1,"2016-11-29T03:36:51","Grospoliner","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t7gmbQ8KxM4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t7gmbQ8KxM4</a></p>"],[1,6977609,0,3,0,3,"2016-11-29T02:08:17","Ginger_Snaps","",[],"<p>Nascar should drive around the bypass highways of big cities. Maybe I'd watch it. </p>"],[2,7114893,6977609,0,0,0,"2016-12-07T22:14:35","JastheMace","",[],"<p>Only if they do it like 'Death Race 2000'</p>"],[1,6977998,0,3,0,3,"2016-11-29T02:38:53","Rellik88","",[],"<p>When I was a kid, It blew my mind how hard motorcycles leaned in MotoGP. Then I got a motorcycle and realized how much fun it is.</p>"],[1,6978184,0,12,2,10,"2016-11-29T02:53:27","derram","",[],"<p>non-imgur link: <a href=\"https://files.catbox.moe/5h190i.mp4\">https://files.catbox.moe/5h190i.mp4</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/vyRk2u.png\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"],[1,6978354,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-29T03:07:17","whatisbestinlife","",[],"<p>i hope this is what i get when i buy road rash VR</p>"],[1,6978398,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-29T03:12:04","Rb8623","",[],"<p>My butt cheeks tightened up after every curve.</p>"],[1,6978699,0,2,0,2,"2016-11-29T03:37:28","BentAxel","",[],"<p>The fucking TT. There's a lot of really, really great riders who wont touch that race. I think its one of the last bastions of men with Balls. All Hail <a href=\"https://youtu.be/Giqkv8K45nk\">the King</a></p>"],[2,6981952,6978699,1,0,1,"2016-11-29T10:10:25","hairybawbag","",[],"<p>Guy Martin is the man. Makes cucumbers look red hot.</p>"],[1,6980354,0,0,1,-1,"2016-11-29T06:09:48","jewjoints","",[],"<p>Ive done around 190ish in a car on the highway in a 911tt, its much less horrifying in a car, believe me</p>"],[2,6981372,6980354,2,0,2,"2016-11-29T08:26:21","crazy_eyes","",[],"<p>depends on the car</p>"],[3,6981431,6981372,0,1,-1,"2016-11-29T08:33:47","jewjoints","[e]",[],"<p>very true, it was a 2008 911 twin turbo so it could handle it, a lesser car may just fall apart</p>\n<p>edit: tried this in a friends bently GT sport special and a spyker test drive, also felt real nice because of the weight but felt less comfortable with sharp small maneuvers in the touring cars</p>"],[1,6981088,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-29T07:39:45","Vvswiftvv17","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks. Last person I asked what this looked like was Paul Walker and he still hasn't got back with me. Maybe I should call him.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Oh fuck....lmao</p>"],[1,7016873,0,1,0,1,"2016-12-01T16:12:02","HaHaBird","",[],"<p>Do bikes have any sort of downforce? Watching this video, it looks to me like going over a crest could really easily spend all of your traction, and end quite badly.</p>"],[1,7114902,0,0,0,0,"2016-12-07T22:15:01","JastheMace","",[],"<p>Can't do that here in America, the potholes would kill these guys. </p>"]]
